ics within  the band lennon mccartney already  started competing for preeminence within  the band a duel fought with lyrics and  melodies as weapons of choice harrison  still a junior member was relegated to  the backseat but from there he observed  listened and learned and he developed  his signature lead guitar style one that  eschewed fretboard gymnastics preferring  carefully crafted riffs and short solos  in which every single note had a purpose  and every lick had a story but this  early adventure was doomed to be  short-lived in october 1960 the beatles  were booked by a new club the top ten  their kaiser keller promoter bruno  cosmeter was furious for this betrayal  and he got revenge he snitched the  police that harrison was still a miner  resulting in his expulsion mccartney and  best retaliated by setting a condom on  fire in one of koschmeider's venues  which resulted in their expulsion as  well by december 1960 the beatles were  reunited in liverpool performing at the  legendary cavern club amongst the  screaming sweaty teenagers that one  proud mum mrs harrison singing along  with the other fans the apple of her eye  could not stay 17 forever though in  april of 1961 once george had turned 18  the band returned to hamburg now quick  question for you how many times have you  been on the internet and noticed creepy  ads that seem to be following you around  and tailored to your search history or  speaking of search history how many  times you've been worried that somebody  maybe even your government is tracking  the websites that you visit well  fortunately for you today's video is  sponsored by nordvpn which is helping to  give internet users all the tricks and  tools of a proper 21st century online  experience now you may have heard me  talk about what nordvpn could do for you  previously encrypt your internet data  move your activity to another location  with just one click either for superior  security or more streaming options and  all that's still 